  "notes": "Secondary years are numbered 1–7 (1AS–7AS): collège 1–4 ends with the BEPC, lycée 5–7 ends with the Bac, 7th year by stream (7C, 7D...). National certificates fall in Primary 6, Secondary 4 and Secondary 7. The 2022 orientation law and PNDSE III target nine years of compulsory basic education (primary and collège)."
